      "prompt": "A sum of $208$ dollars is partitioned between two research teams in the ratio $4 : 9$. How many dollars does the team with the larger share receive?",
      "display": "\\text{Share}_2 = 208 \\times \\frac{9}{4 + 9}",
      "plainText": "ratio 4:9 with mult 16",
